select 'seed-ocio-outage', 'Jonathan Moody', 'reviewer', 'Strong upside but this is the most complex one in the queue. Before I score it: what''s the current user-impacting incident baseline, and what false-alert rate would ops actually tolerate? Need those to judge feasibility.', now()
